# Build artifacts. Harnesses are built inside the container into /work/bin,
# but keep this here so a manual host/container build in-tree stays untracked.
build/
*.o
*.log
fuzz_merge
fuzz_strategies
fuzz_callback
fuzz_idempotent
*_asan_ubsan
*_asan_lsan

# Corpus growth. The SEED corpora (generated by gen_corpus.py) are tracked so a
# fresh clone fuzzes productively from exec #1. Inputs discovered during a
# campaign are NOT — they grow without bound and add no regression value on
# their own. Prune with `-merge=1` and commit deliberately if you want CI to
# inherit a campaign's coverage. See README.md.

# Crash artifacts ARE tracked: a reproducer is evidence, and every one of them
# must also become a unit test in ../test_syncer.c.
!crashes/
